# Build context for workshop/backend/docker/Dockerfile.
# Only capx/ (minus the third_party vendor dirs the `robosuite` extra doesn't
# need), env_configs/, workshop/backend/, and the uv project manifests are
# needed to run the sandboxed Session Worker.

.git
.github
.z
.venv
outputs
web-ui
workshop/webui
workshop/docker
node_modules

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
*.egg-info

# Third-party vendor trees not needed by the `robosuite` extra.
# capx/third_party/robosuite IS needed (the `robosuite` extra itself).
# capx/third_party/sam3 IS needed too: `sam3` is an *unconditional*
# dependency in [project.dependencies] (pyproject.toml:45), not gated by any
# extra, so `uv sync` requires it regardless of which extras are selected.
capx/third_party/b1k
capx/third_party/contact_graspnet_pytorch
capx/third_party/LIBERO-PRO
capx/third_party/libero_dependencies
capx/third_party/curobo
capx/third_party/verl

WORKSHOP_REFACTOR_PLAN.md
WORKSHOP_WEBUI_SPEC.md
